    "description": "Download the Caracol News application completely free to find out about all the news today, news from Colombia, international news, news from Venezuela and much more news information happening in all parts of Colombia and the world. Our sections contain updated information on sports news, political news, entertainment news. Our application offers a pleasant user experience, in which all our contents in video, image or text can be consulted consuming the minimum data of your cellular operator. In addition to this, when saving the contents, you can consume them later without consuming data and in offline mode. You can share the contents with all your contacts. After installed you can qualify the experience obtained.",
